I lift my face; sighs don't suit me

00:00:21.648 --> 00:00:22.690
Damn it

00:00:22.899 --> 00:00:26.778
Someone's voice asks, "How's everyone doing?"

00:00:26.986 --> 00:00:29.489
How we do right now, hey hey hey

00:00:29.697 --> 00:00:34.452
